 [[cafe]].\``,`vn`:`\`C\u00f2n \u0111\u1ed3 u\u1ed1ng th\u00ec sao?\` b\u00e0 h\u1ecfi. Mai vi\u1ebft: tr\u00e0, c\u00e0 ph\u00ea v\u00e0 n\u01b0\u1edbc cam. \`Th\u1ebf c\u00f2n bia? R\u01b0\u1ee3u vang?\` \`Kh\u00f4ng,\` b\u00e0 n\u00f3i. \`Nh\u00e0 h\u00e0ng nh\u1ecf c\u1ee7a m\u00ecnh d\u00e0nh cho c\u00e1c gia \u0111\u00ecnh. \u0110\u00e2y l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t qu\u00e1n c\u00e0 ph\u00ea t\u1ea1i nh\u00e0.\``},{`en`:`[[On]] [[Saturday]] [[morning]], [[the]] [[menu]] [[is|be]] [[on]] [[the]] [[door]]. Mai [[opens|open]] [[the]] [[windows|window]]. Grandma [[cooks|cook]] [[in]] [[the]] [[kitchen]], [[and]] [[the]] [[food]] [[is|be]] [[hot]] [[and]] [[delicious]]. [[But]] [[one]] [[hour]] [[goes|go]] [[by]], [[then]] [[two]]. [[Nobody]] [[comes|come]].`,`vn`:`S\u00e1ng th\u1ee9 B\u1ea3y, th\u1ef1c \u0111\u01a1n \u0111\u00e3 \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c d\u00e1n tr\u00ean c\u1eeda. Mai m\u1edf h\u1ebft c\u1eeda s\u1ed5. B\u00e0 n\u1ea5u trong b\u1ebfp, \u0111\u1ed3 \u0103n v\u1eeba n\u00f3ng v\u1eeba ngon. Nh\u01b0ng m\u1ed9t ti\u1ebfng tr\u00f4i qua, r\u1ed3i hai ti\u1ebfng. Ch\u1eb3ng c\u00f3 ai \u0111\u1ebfn.`},{`en`:`Mai [[looks|look]] [[out]] [[at]] [[the]] [[street]]. [[There]] [[is|be]] [[nobody]]. \`[[Maybe]] [[this]] [[is|be]] [[a]] [[bad]] [[idea]],\` [[she]] [[says|say]]. [[Then]], [[at]] [[twelve]] [[o'clock]], [[somebody]] [[is|be]] [[at]] [[the]] [[door]].`,`vn`:`Mai nh\u00ecn ra ph\u1ed1. Kh\u00f4ng m\u1ed9t b\u00f3ng ng\u01b0\u1eddi. \`C\u00f3 l\u1ebd \u0111\u00e2y l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t \u00fd t\u1ed3i,\` c\u00f4 n\u00f3i. R\u1ed3i \u0111\u00fang m\u01b0\u1eddi hai gi\u1edd, c\u00f3 ai \u0111\u00f3 \u0111\u1ee9ng tr\u01b0\u1edbc c\u1eeda.`}],`tease`:`Ai \u0111ang \u0111\u1ee9ng tr\u01b0\u1edbc c\u1eeda v\u1eady?`}]}